<%- layout("layouts/boilerplate") %>
<main>
  <section id="alteration">
    <div>
      <img
        src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/36731276/pexels-photo-36731276.jpeg"
        alt="alteration"
      />
      <h2>Alterations</h2>
    </div>

    <p
      style="
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        text-justify: center;
      "
    >
      Are you looking to alter your wedding dress? Does the fit of your trousers
      need altering? Whether you’ve bought a new favourite, dropped a hem or a
      few pounds, we offer a wide range of alteration and repair services where
      we look to improve the fit or repair your existing garments or suits. From
      shortening to the complete rebuild of a garment, we cover all aspects of
      clothing alterations for your convenience and to ensure you look and feel
      your very best.
    </p>
    <h4 style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; margin-bottom: 20px">
      Our Services includes:
    </h4>
    <ul style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; margin-bottom: 20px">
      <li>Clothing alterations</li>
      <li>Special occasion alterations</li>
      <li>Replacing of zips</li>
      <li>Bridal alterations</li>
      <li>Taking in/letting out clothing</li>
      <li>Bespoke fitting</li>
    </ul>
    <p style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; margin-bottom: 20px">
      With decades of experience, our seamstresses are dedicated to providing
      the highest quality alterations service. We ensure to pay close attention
      so that every detail from the orginal garment is retained, you can feel
      confident that your vintage designer jacket is in good hands. If you’re
      unsure how to pin your garment, or just how much needs altering, feel free
      to bring your garment into our showroom, and one of our tailors or
      seamstresses will happily advise on your alterations at no extra charge.
    </p>
    <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto">
      <img
        src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/6765648/pexels-photo-6765648.jpeg"
        alt=""
      />
      <img
        src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/6766302/pexels-photo-6766302.jpeg"
        alt=""
      />
      <img
        src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/6766373/pexels-photo-6766373.jpeg"
        alt=""
      />
      <img
        src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/6766244/pexels-photo-6766244.jpeg"
        alt=""
      />
    </div>
    <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto">
      <h2>The Workroom</h2>
      <img
        src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/6766383/pexels-photo-6766383.jpeg"
        alt=""
        style="margin-top: 20px; object-fit: cover"
      />
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
